  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/981858?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=#F16436&amp;link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-recipe\" alt=\"Curse Forge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/7AXsRqp1?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=#00AF5C&amp;link=https://modrinth.com/datapack/extra-recipe\" alt=\"Modrinth下载量\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/CTNStudio/Extra-Recipe?display_timestamp=committer&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;color=#181717&amp;link=https://github.com/CTNStudio/Extra-Recipe\" alt=\"GitHub最后提交\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152184082130813009?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;color=#5865F2&amp;cacheSeconds=https://discord.gg/2Eb53FxvYf&amp;link=https://discord.gg/ZUzg99PDsw\" alt=\"Discord服务器\"></p><p>还在为找不到附魔金苹果而烦恼？依旧对铁砧磨损束手无策？</p><p>额外配方来帮您解决这些难题！本项目的具体功能或新增内容：钻石/金/铁马铠配方、命名牌配方、不死图腾配方、附魔金苹果配方（以及更多！）……</p><p>为何要下载本模组：因为实在太棒了 :)</p><p>下载前须知：欢迎随时向我咨询相关问题。</p><p>祝您玩得愉快！</p><h2>版本兼容性</h2><p>关于文件后缀：后缀代表所支持的版本。具体支持的版本请参见下表。</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本后缀</th>\n<th>Minecraft版本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>1.13 – 1.14.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-5</td>\n<td>1.15 – 1.16.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-6</td>\n<td>1.16.2 – 1.16.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-7</td>\n<td>1.17 – 1.17.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-8</td>\n<td>1.18 – 1.18.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-9</td>\n<td>1.18.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-10</td>\n<td>1.19 – 1.19.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-12</td>\n<td>1.19.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-15</td>\n<td>1.20 – 1.20.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-18</td>\n<td>1.20.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-26</td>\n<td>1.20.3 – 1.20.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-41</td>\n<td>1.20.5 – 1.20.6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-48</td>\n<td>1.21 – 1.21.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-57</td>\n<td>1.21.2 – 1.21.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-61</td>\n<td>1.21.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-71</td>\n<td>1.21.5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-80</td>\n<td>1.21.6</td